		(property "Verification" "Remote FRONT LEFT HLK-LD2450 through a four-wire harness. Carrier Grove4P 2mm: 1=sensorTX,2=sensorRX,3=M2 switched5V,4=GND. Radar factory plug is not Grove: use matching sensor cable end and map by signal labels. 3.3V UART, default256000 8N1. No radar body mounted to motherboard. Exterior 3D-printed bracket is separate work; user requests upright, diagonally outward corner mounting. Located in the left side interface column."
			(at 0 0 270)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
