		(property "Verification" "Board-side Grove4P 2mm: MCU RX,MCU TX,3.3V,GND. Physical breakout only; not a new independent peripheral controller. Shared running UART. A receive-only monitor may observe TX. Release/disconnect the existing transmitter before attaching an active external TX; software silence is not high impedance. Located in the right side interface column."
