		(property "Verification" "Rear region Grove4P 2mm: SCL,SDA,3.3V,GND. Physical breakout only; not a new independent peripheral controller. Same S3_D4/D5 bus as S3 master, RP slave, UPS, IMU and OLED. RP and S3 have separate 3V3 regulator outputs; only the I2C signals and GND are common. Placed in the rear connector bank, clear of the airflow corridor."
